last your way to success!<br></li><li>You have a limited number of moves for each level, so plan each move accordingly.</li></ul><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy the scenery of the journey<br></li><li>Help Meidu change clothes<br></li><li>Challenging match-3 game<br></li><li>Find the gold coins hidden in the carriage</li></ul>",
